  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Plotting region for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math>, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0069_29d38a277e15.png\" style=\"width: 378px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>The intersection points of the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Here chord <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> subtends a right angle at the centre of the circle.<br />So, required area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo></math> area of segment of circle on chord <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo></math>&nbsp;[area of quarter circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo></math> area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math>]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>360</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
